    "comment": "Per-use fragility on the fired clay vessels that take part in the ware ladder. Crucibles and both mold types are deliberately excluded: they are fire-clay-only, they are excluded from porcelain for the same reason, and they already have their own vanilla thermal-shock shatter — stacking a second break roll on top would be a nasty surprise. The decorative *-fancy vessels are excluded because they have no greenware form, so a player could never fire them to a better tier: a permanent break chance with no upgrade path is a pure nerf.",
